msgstr "在账户页连接以加载 Orca 模型。"

msgid "Endpoint changed. Select Refresh to contact it."
msgstr "端点已更改。点击刷新以连接。"

msgid "Using a manual Model ID. Select Refresh to restore discovered models."
msgstr "正在使用手动模型 ID。点击刷新以恢复发现的模型。"

